hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2187","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne ameer mein se cheez naapasand karey wo sabr karey. Beshak jo hukumat se baalisht nikla aur mara wo jaahiliyat ki maut mara. (Bukhari: 7053)"
"2188","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik doosri riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jo apne ameer mein se cheez dekhey jo wo naapasand karta hai wo us par sabr karey. Beshak jo jamaat se baalisht juda hua aur mara magar wo jaahiliyat ki maut mara."
"2189","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Logon mein burey hain jinhey Qiyaamat paaeygi jabke wo zinda hain. (Bukhari: 7067)"
"2190","[AI-translation] Maalik key betey Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur un se Hajjaaj se logon ko jo pahuncha uski shikaayat ki gai thi. To unhon-ne kaha: Sabr karo! Beshak tum par zamaana nahi aata magar uskey baad wala us se bura hai yahan tak ke tum apne Rab se milo. Main ne use tumhaarey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai. (Bukhari: 7068)"
"2191","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein koi apne bhai par hathiyaar se ishaara na karey. Beshak wo nahi jaanta, shayed shaitaan uskey haath mein kheencha jaaey aur wo aag key gadhay mein giray. (Bukhari: 7072)"
"2192","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fitnay hongey, un mein baithney wala khadey honay walay se behtar hai. Aur khadey honay wala chalne walay se behtar hai. Aur chalne wala daudnay walay se behtar hai. Jo unkey liye zaahir hoga wo use dhaanp lengey. Phir jo un mein panaah ya najaat paaey to use uskey sath panaah leni chaahiye. (Bukhari: 7081)"
"2193","[AI-translation] Akwa key betey Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Hajjaaj key paas daakhil huey. To us ne kaha: Ae Akwa key betey! Tum apni aidiyon par murtad huey aur dehaati banay? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey jungle mein ijazat di thi. (Bukhari: 7087)"
"2194","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah qaum par azaab naazil karey to azaab usey pahunchta hai jo un mein tha. Phir wo apne aamaal par uthaaye jaaengey. (Bukhari: 7108)"
"2195","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak nifaaq Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein tha. Lekin aaj wo imaan key baad kufr hai. (Bukhari: 7114). Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke Daus ki auraton key koolhay Zu Khalasa par hilengey. Aur Zu Khalasa Daus ka but hai jise wo jaahiliyat mein poojtey they. (7116). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2196","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke Hijaaz ki zameen se aag niklegi jo Busra mein oonton ki gardanon ko roshan karegi. (Bukhari: 7118)"
"2197","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jald Furaat sonay key khazaanay se khul jaaeyga. Phir jo uskey paas haazir ho wo us mein se kuchh na ley. (Bukhari: 7119)"
"2198","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se bhi (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke do badi jamaatein ladengi jinkay darmiyaan badi ladai hogi. Un donon ki daawat aik hogi. Aur yahan tak ke tees key qareeb jhootay Dajjaal bhejay jaaengey. Wo sab gumaan karengey ke wo Allah key Rasool hain. Aur yahan tak ke ilm utha liya jaaeyga aur zalzalay bahut hongey aur zamaana qareeb hoga aur fitnay zaahir hongey aur qatl bahut hoga, aur wo qatl hai, aur yahan tak ke tum mein maal bahut hoga aur behayga yahan tak ke maal walay ko fikr hogi ke uska sadqa kaun qabool karega. Aur yahan tak ke wo use us par pesh karega aur wo jis par wo use pesh karega kahega: Mujhey us mein haajat nahi hai. Aur yahan tak ke log imaarat mein lambay hongey. Aur yahan tak ke aadmi aadmi ki qabr key paas se guzrega aur kahega: Kaash main uski jagah hota! Aur yahan tak ke sooraj maghrib se niklega. Phir jab wo niklega aur log use dekhengey to sab imaan laaengey. To wo waqt hai jab (jaan ko uska imaan faeda na dega jo us se pehley imaan nahi laai thi ya usne apne imaan mein bhalai nahi kamai thi). Aur Qiyaamat zaroor khadi hogi jabke do aadmiyon ne apna kapda un donon key darmiyaan phailaaya hoga aur wo use na bechengey aur na lapetengey. Aur Qiyaamat zaroor khadi hogi jabke aadmi apni doodh wali oontni ka doodh ley kar wapas aaya hoga aur use na khaaeyga. Aur Qiyaamat zaroor khadi hogi jabke wo apna hauz leep raha hoga aur us mein na pilaaeyga. Aur Qiyaamat zaroor khadi hogi jabke us ne apna niwaala apne munh ki taraf uthaaya hoga aur use na khaaeyga. (Bukhari: 7121). Ahkaam ki kitaab."
